/Title (Convert a list to a set when duplicate removal and repeated membership tests matter. Conversion loses ordering and duplicate-count information. If original order or repeated registrations matter, preserve the original list separately. Sorting two lists and walking through them together takes O\(n log n + m log m\) time, plus O\(n + m\) traversal. Nested loops take O\(nm\). Set operations take O\(n + m\) average time and O\(n + m\) additional space in the worst case.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1476 0 R
>>
endobj
