<<
/Title (Sets automatically remove duplicates because each element can occur only once. Membership testing in a set is O\(1\) average using hashing, while membership in a list is O\(n\) because elements may be checked one by one. Sets cannot contain lists because lists are mutable and unhashable; tuples can be members when all their elements are hashable.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1499 0 R
/Prev 1507 0 R
>>
endobj
